# piglit-lenovo.flakes: the tests and subtests of the Lenovo's piglit cases
# (tests/native/gpu.cases) that are not judged, one extended regular
# expression a line, searched for in the name.
#
# arb_query_buffer_object@qbo and its subtests come and go on Linux on
# Haswell: Mesa 25.0.7's CI lists the test among crocus's Haswell flakes
# (src/gallium/drivers/crocus/ci/crocus-hsw-flakes.txt, since Mesa's commit
# fd8e31198866). Rach2 warned one of its subtests where step 9's one run
# passed it, and passed it in the runs before (dev-log/84-locks/84-266z30.md).
^spec@arb_query_buffer_object@qbo(@|$)
